5. what the portable build adds (not in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------

tools/fetch_deps.py downloads these and tools/build_portable.py bundles them,
unmodified, into the release zip:

  cpython 3.12 (python-build-standalone)   python software foundation license
  qt 6 and pyside6                         lgpl-3.0
  shiboken6                                lgpl-3.0
  mss                                      mit
  pyaudiowpatch / portaudio                mit

each package's license travels inside the zip, in runtime\LICENSE.txt and in
the *.dist-info folders of runtime\Lib\site-packages. qt and pyside6 are used
as unmodified dynamic libraries and can be replaced with compatible versions.


